  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Desk Study - Water Recycling Plant Pilot Project, through Performance Technology, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This desk study reviewed a proposal for a feasibility study and pilot project for the deployment of a two million gallon per day (MGD) water recycling facility in Pakistan. A U.S. company would partner with International Water Associates Pakistan, a company that provides total water recycling solutions, to engineer and construct the pilot facility through a private-public partnership on land authorized by the municipality of Karachi.</narrative>
  </description>
